st AI, or claim your plot on a worldwide leaderboard and become a strategy game legend.\n\n\nKEY FEATURES:\n\n1. Experience another faithful boardgame conversion from the studio behind Le Havre: The Inland Port and Patchwork.\n2. Engage in exciting 1v1 cross-platform multiplayer matches against players from all over the world.\n3. Focus on breeding the largest and most varied livestock.\n4. Use the Playback feature to review your best games and learn new tricks from the pros.\n5. Stay on your toes with challenging AI.", "minimumOsVersion": "12.0", "averageUserRatingForCurrentVersion": 3.6, "languageCodesISO2A": ["EN", "FR", "DE", "IT", "JA", "KO", "RU", "ZH", "ES"], "fileSizeBytes": "138378240", "formattedPrice": "￦6,600", "userRatingCountForCurrentVersion": 5, "trackContentRating": "4+", "bundleId": "com.digidiced.abvrelease", "averageUserRating": 3.6, "trackCensoredName": "Agricola All Creatures 2p", "trackViewUrl": "https://apps.apple.com/kr/app/agricola-all-creatures-2p/id1118398079?uo=4", "contentAdvisoryRating": "4+", "genres": ["게임", "전략", "보드"], "artistId": 1135862620, "artistName": "Twin Sails Interactive", "userRatingCount": 5}]}